+**Storage**: Durable workspace credit balance plus durable retry reservation record; concrete datastore is not established.  
+**Testing**: Existing project test runner is not established; required scenarios are specified in [quickstart.md](quickstart.md).  
+**Target Platform**: Backend/service send path.  
+**Project Type**: B2B SaaS service, inferred from `.speck/project.json`; source layout is not present.  
+**Performance Goals**: No numeric target specified. Reservation must complete before provider invocation and preserve atomicity under concurrent attempts.  
+**Constraints**: Never make a workspace balance negative; never charge a failed, timed-out, or cancelled attempt; duplicate callbacks must be idempotent.  
+**Scale/Scope**: One per-workspace quota and one reservation lifecycle per send attempt.
+
+## Constitution Check
