+- Code quality: keep lifecycle transitions in one quota component or transaction boundary, not duplicated across provider outcome handlers.
+- Quality assurance: test each terminal state and the concurrent reservation race.
+- Performance: no target is specified; correctness and atomicity take precedence over reducing one datastore round trip.
